ve opening historical; active opening is a 0.80×0.50 m vellum sheet. On a later owner-requested commit, stage JG-035 paths only and include the matching doc updates. [Task 2]\n104:- Before calling JG-035 done: add `__drawingProof` probes for pulse registration and text/title bounds; regenerate missing `public/drawing/jgun-sheet-v1.json.gz` with cache bypass, chrome fallback, and correct `waitForFunction(pageFn, arg, options)` ordering; re-measure `projectedFeatures` at registered hold `t=0.40–0.72`; verify `ink.tri` subdivision and troika injection order; run the harness against a fresh `:5198` server and obtain a fresh read-only review. [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
